        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For the product candidates we develop and plan to commercialize, as a normal course of business, we have been granted and intend to continue to pursue composition and method of manufacture and use, including therapeutic use, patents, as well as novel indications for our product candidates.",
